OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADame Esther Rantzen, broadcaster,
OL,4,Acampaigner and charity founder, dies
OL,5,Aaged 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham is among those to have
OL,8,Fpaid tribute, saying she "changed
OL,9,Fcountless lives", while MP Kim
OL,10,FLeadbeater, who campaigned to legalise
OL,11,Fassisted dying, has called her "strong,
OL,12,Fwarm and compassionate"
OL,14,FCharities have also praised Rantzen's
OL,15,F"extraordinary legacy" and say she
OL,16,F"used her platform to speak truth to
OL,17,Fpower"
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
